dfec8cab (23 1792178946668 "guenchi" (("w5vbequy" . 14982)) (put ((kind . section) (title . "landing f302") (src . "landing-commit tags the start of a landing before it commits\n\nThe publication of a landing needs a start tag whose export equals the git base, and\nthe first landing through the store had none: the seed was never tagged and the commit\nran before any tag. landing-commit now takes --start <name>: after its checks it tags\nthe applied cut under that name, refuses a name already bound (a rebind would move an\nearlier landing's start) and refuses when the tag bound a cut other than the pinned\none, committing nothing in either case; the answer carries the tag and its cut. A hold\nstage before the tag lets a fixture reach the moved-cut refusal. The README documents\nthe option and the stage; the switch and landing runbooks tag the seed.\n") (parent . root) (ord . 405))))
